---
import StarlightPage from '@astrojs/starlight/components/StarlightPage.astro';
---
<StarlightPage frontmatter={{ title: 'Verifier registry (stub)' }}>
  <h1>Verifier profile registry &amp; app_type dispatch</h1>
  <div class="callout-warn">
    <strong>Stubbed for follow-up.</strong> This page will render the verifier
    profile registry (<code>unit</code>, <code>api</code>, <code>batch</code>,
    <code>pr-ci</code>, <code>docs</code>) and the
    <code>app_type_verifier_map</code> dispatch table that picks a verifier
    profile based on the delegation bundle's <code>verification.app_type</code>
    field.
  </div>
  <p>
    The full design lives in
    <a href="https://github.com/AGOrcha/dot-agents/blob/master/docs/WORKFLOW_AUTOMATION_PRODUCT_SPEC.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
      WORKFLOW_AUTOMATION_PRODUCT_SPEC.md</a>
    and the lesson
    <a href="https://github.com/AGOrcha/dot-agents/blob/master/.agents/lessons/verifier-owns-ci-watch-shift-left/LESSON.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
      verifier-owns-ci-watch-shift-left</a>.
  </p>
</StarlightPage>

<style>
  .callout-warn {
    border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-orange);
    border-left-width: 0.25rem;
    border-radius: 0.4rem;
    background: var(--sl-color-orange-low);
    color: var(--sl-color-orange-high);
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    margin: 1rem 0;
  }
</style>
